yEsAJPUh6rVJtv_kIQ_zgn6GC71Lk2zwKZMMdReOPGmNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyEznsh2XVGw4Uj5PYVZZxd5Gdw0NlWfVES_f1YQeZNeA&oe=69B17255"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_03.png", "id": "1078013840882615", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499356638_1078013844215948_4431526408350712785_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rfYUSjyfPYMQ7kNvwHvP97h&_nc_oc=AdkZzePRg8HVssKZ7UD5Jyb8roAEjDvNbg10MFGuZym7XM5fJuswrU5f7amehDORZ9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy92ERdmUM8KQzgFEKyB10L4OmmUc1D9zNhi8VObi7rQg&oe=69B1630E"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_01.png", "id": "548187144806946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324048_548187148140279_302708763491369627_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZLQe4PzFtcsQ7kNvwFvw244&_nc_oc=Adneeriid4iFjuEE7XBHDR_CR7Ykcm-DZdisR3GsiU72keMN7FFlgKu9iC-ESpPhOn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwJ9toQbEDimMEqpl0ShJPAZSepUkl7tDfdCK_TiNBDFA&oe=69B16374"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_05.png", "id": "1416446512843773", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324939_1416446516177106_7952489805788314366_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CMRwpYwgJR0Q7kNvwF1ALY_&_nc_oc=AdkgOTwowcuketnSO7obN5H9og7TkEEsQMrMv2Zspjspa36SLl0MqkkHgsdwxETzSWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxGZj30w-VO9nxGgbwIGXU31b-UINO8-N0yckeXK6kr6Q&oe=69B147BA"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_06.png", "id": "1188825093024789", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499333143_1188825096358122_7698089225442683365_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q1YW-kGeM0IQ7kNvwG6xQAc&_nc_oc=AdmVHe96HkvqXBiYaUtoONEPfZLA7yh3R_TOM1XZ69pGJ9oFZcfJTN8WkNJE_gmcU1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx3XnMjFtuQO2J7Ga8bNoPZMjocftBcae-j5BVv9Nny0Q&oe=69B15FD1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "V8 Engine Simulation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock the mysteries of automotive engineering with our cutting-edge V8 Engine Training Simulator. Immerse yourself in a virtual world where learning meets hands-on experience, allowing enthusiasts, students, and professionals to grasp the intricacies of V8 engine assembly like never before.\n\nPowered by state-of-the-art technology, our simulator utilises a real V8 engine model, providing an authentic and comprehensive learning experience. Whether you're a novice eager to explore the mechanics or a seasoned automotive enthusiast aiming to enhance your knowledge, our simulator caters to all skill levels.\n\nKey Features:\n\n1. Real Engine Integration: Our simulator boasts a genuine V8 engine, enabling users to interact with real components and understand their functions.\n\n2. Interactive Learning Modules: Dive into an array of interactive modules that cover every aspect of V8 engine assembly, from identifying parts to mastering the intricacies of fuel injection systems.\n\n3. Real-Time Feedback: Receive instant feedback on your assembly progress, allowing for continuous improvement and a deeper understanding of the engine's inner workings.\n\n4. Step-by-Step Tutorials: Guided by detailed step-by-step tutorials, users can progress at their own pace, ensuring a thorough grasp of each assembly stage.\n\n\n\n\nUnleash your passion for engines and master the art of V8 assembly like never before!\n", "short_description": "Discover the art of V8 engine assembly with our state-of-the-art Training Simulator! Featuring a real V8 engine, interactive modules, and step-by-step tutorials, our simulator caters to all skill levels. Gain hands-on experience, receive real-time feedback, and master the intricacies of automotive engineering. Elevate your knowledge with our immersive and authentic V8 Engine Training Simulator today! \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/privacy-pol